{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":113808,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2024,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nkkDhwL9p0UlWXtPnKYefCRX1j8.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"5521031","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Quando ti ho incontrato in questo mondo, tu eri...","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Just after rescuing Celia from her wedding, Rio witnesses six pillars of light. He heads towards them at Aishia's behest and finds three people he never imagined meeting in his world... and they need his help!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wFPsRc1w8nyDelJKTsofnDAuCLG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wFPsRc1w8nyDelJKTsofnDAuCLG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"5638748","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Compere in un altro mondo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rio cerca di insegnare ai nuovi arrivati qualcosa in più sul mondo in cui si trovano, ma anche Celia ha i suoi interrogativi su cui indagare. Mentre Rio, Miharu e compagni fanno compere ad Amande, la Profezia continua a realizzarsi...","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pszw4sJjCaUu0pcK8rycaHtrwSl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pszw4sJjCaUu0pcK8rycaHtrwSl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"5638749","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"La mia casa è sotto attacco","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rio decide di contattare gli Antichi del Villaggio degli Spiriti per chiedere informazioni e un favore. Nel frattempo, mentre Liselotte parla con una degli Eroi, un pericolo si avvicina a Miharu e compagnia.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fr6UF1Coel3fk7H93XZCKS9OP7I.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fr6UF1Coel3fk7H93XZCKS9OP7I.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"5638750","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"精霊の民の里にやって来たセリアと美春たちの歓迎会が催される。リオにとって大切な存在である彼女たちに対し、ラティーファは自分にも日本人だった前世の記憶があることを打ち明け、美春たちのシュトラール語の先生になると宣言する。それから数日後、リオはセリアの手紙を両親へ手紙を届けるため、故郷のロダニアへ行くことを提案する。里に美春たちを残し、リオはセリアとアイシアとともにセリアの生家へと旅立つ！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-10-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yGbzX6mIobU7W9cWpVKX8I1GfpF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yGbzX6mIobU7W9cWpVKX8I1GfpF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"5638751","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ワイバーンに遭遇したリーゼロッテ一行は、近くの都市ノワへ降り立つ。そこにはユグノー公爵の飛行船も避難していた。陸路を使うというリーゼロッテに、坂田は自分たちもついて行くと告げ、馬車でアマンドへ同行することになる。その道中、突如無数の魔物に襲われる一行。アリアを筆頭に侍女たちの活躍で何とか耐え凌ぐ戦闘の最中、さらに強力な伝説の魔物ミノタウロスが現れ、フローラとリーゼロッテに襲い掛かる――","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rISqEF6F38lk4SvqK7MphL3ATVQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rISqEF6F38lk4SvqK7MphL3ATVQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"5638752","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"リーゼロッテたちの窮地を救ったリオは、一行の中にベルトラム王国の学院で旧友だったフローラとロアナがいることを知り、ハルトと名乗って正体を偽る。だがフローラは、名前も髪の色も違うハルトにリオの面影を感じていた。なりゆきで一緒の馬車に同乗してアマンドに向かうことになったリオ。一方精霊の里では、亜紀が子供の頃を思い出し、一人立ちすくんでいた。それはかつての兄、天川春人との悲しい別れの記憶だった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bPOVu3Ca1PoWZfdFuji8Z93eX0t.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bPOVu3Ca1PoWZfdFuji8Z93eX0t.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"5638753","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rio rejoins Celia and Aishia in Amande. They go out to dine in a private room at a restaurant. Then Alphonse bursts in with his friends and demands they get out. Not wanting trouble, Rio and the others move to leave, but Alphonse blocks their way!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xfw5wNfdqovygQ9rCz0Yf0z7OA6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xfw5wNfdqovygQ9rCz0Yf0z7OA6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"5638754","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the knights investigate the forest, they are attacked and subdued in a flash. When Alphonse wakes, he witnesses a horrible sight. Meanwhile, Flora's thoughts of Haruto overlap with memories of Rio. Her swirling emotions keep her awake.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hnOPLqD0WJ9bXf6kq4nVxJbpdmQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnOPLqD0WJ9bXf6kq4nVxJbpdmQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"5638755","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Amande is attacked by monsters, plunging the townspeople into chaos and fear. Liselotte deploys her attendants to help limit the damage, and Rio goes to the east gate to help. Meanwhile, Lucius and the revenants swiftly approach their target.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-12-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eRAKSYkmfx18WddEIeQuXg8HKjL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eRAKSYkmfx18WddEIeQuXg8HKjL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"5638756","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Revenants attack the room where Sakata, Flora, and the others have taken shelter. Sakata leaps into action and Flora manages to flee into the hallway, but there are other dangers lying in wait. Rio notices something wrong and pursues it alone.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-12-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ty7fipdZphZwVEwuBhNnqH378E.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ty7fipdZphZwVEwuBhNnqH378E.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"5638757","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the Village of Spirits, Miharu wakes from an unsettling dream. Meanwhile, Rio catches up to Flora's kidnapper, Lucius. Rio calmly moves to bring Lucius down. His attitude irritates Lucius, who tries to provoke him into revealing his true identity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-12-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r6AuBH5lU6Ba09IzBGeY6BVWtfo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r6AuBH5lU6Ba09IzBGeY6BVWtfo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"5638758","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Flora manages to speak to Rio, but it doesn't go the way she expects. Liselotte and the others tell Rio they'd like to show their gratitude, so he makes a request. Then, Rio travels back to the village to tell Miharu and the others what he's learned.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-12-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vCkj81Y1xNaD9mndyTT5VC9WR9D.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vCkj81Y1xNaD9mndyTT5VC9WR9D.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113808/season/2"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793373161056,"status":"ok"}}}
